{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","content":"Exit code 1\n21:The tool has also grown more surface than it uses. Across 413 real `cursor_run` calls, every one ran in the background, `plan` capability was never used, `allowPartialCommit` and `idleMs` were never set, `cursor_wait_any` ran twice, and several parameters (`verifyCommands`, `promptPreamble`, `requireNonClaude`, the `allowUnsandboxed` second signal) only add prompt text or guard against cases that never happen. Eight MCP tools and fourteen run parameters cost schema tokens in every session and make the skill long.\n60:28. As an orchestrating agent, I want resume to reuse the job's model, directory, capability and gate, so that I cannot forget a setting on the follow-up.\n73:41. As a user, I want cursor read-write runs unsandboxed, so that delegates can clone, push and open PRs.\n79:47. As a user, I want my existing host profile moved to the new config location by setup, so that my settings survive the rename.\n98:delegate run    --model M [--capability read-only|read-write] [--cwd D] [--gate CMD] [--tool-idle-ms N] [--prompt-file F | stdin]\n99:delegate resume <jobId> [--model M] [--capability C] [--gate CMD] [--prompt-file F | stdin]\n106:Removed with no replacement: `cursor_poll`, `cursor_wait`, `cursor_wait_any`, `cursor_wait_all`, `cursor_answer`; parameters `waitMs`, `background`, `session`, `isolation`, `verifyCommands`, `allowPartialCommit`, `idleMs`, `requireNonClaude`, `allowUnsandboxed`; capabilities `plan` and `write-unsandboxed`; host-profile fields `promptPreamble`, `verifyCommands`, `requiredDeny`, `deadlineMs`; the deny-list check; BackendProvided worktrees; MCP progress notifications; the `family` model field; the doctor plugin-registration and legacy-name checks.\n122:- **cursor**: `cursor-agent --print --output-format stream-json --trust --approve-mcps --force`. read-only is ask mode; read-write is `--sandbox disabled`. Resume by the session id from the result line. Cost from the model table.\n123:- **pi**: `pi -p --mode json --model provider/id`, full user configuration loaded. Session id chosen before launch with `--session-id`; resume reuses it. read-only is rejected. Cost is pi's own reported cost.\n124:- **claude**: `claude -p --output-format stream-json --verbose --model ...`, full user configuration loaded. Session id chosen before launch with `--session-id`; resume with `--resume`. read-only is `--permission-mode plan`; read-write is `--permission-mode auto`. Cost is the result line's `total_cost_usd`. The stream closely matches cursor's, so the parser should share most of cursor's.\n130:**Doctor.** Plugin/binary version; per backend: binary found, version, login (cursor `about`, pi `auth check`, claude equivalent); per model: available on its backend (cursor `--list-models`, pi `auth check --model`). Missing models are warnings.\n153:- Sandboxing any backend, or a seatbelt wrapper for pi.\ncursor/lane-8-ci-repair.stdout\ncursor/ponytail-19.stdout\ncursor/lane-8-ci-repair.argv\ncursor/preflight-7.stdout\ncursor/preflight-7.argv\ncursor/ponytail-19.argv\ncursor/ponytail-18.argv\ncursor/lane-8-ci.stdout\ncursor/ponytail-18.stdout\nclaude/review-19.stdout\n  35 /Users/user\n 186 /Users/user\nclaude/review-18.stdout\n1.7M\t.\n  431970 cursor/ponytail-18.stdout\n  175819 cursor/preflight-7.stdout\n  174974 pi/cancelled.stdout\n  782763 total","is_error":true,"tool_use_id":"toolu_019cExtXuYqSGwSxpUdYaKTt"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3dfd18ba-a3ed-4a44-bd90-c4ca03e8efdd","uuid":"797cfe15-0894-4fe8-8311-9be1f92b1294","timestamp":"2026-10-01T08:27:17.686Z","tool_use_result":"Error: Exit code 1\n21:The tool has also grown more surface than it uses. Across 413 real `cursor_run` calls, every one ran in the background, `plan` capability was never used, `allowPartialCommit` and `idleMs` were never set, `cursor_wait_any` ran twice, and several parameters (`verifyCommands`, `promptPreamble`, `requireNonCl